uint64 map_version
geometry_msgs/Pose goal
geometry_msgs/Pose base
float64 time_available_s
float64 energy_available_wh
bool oxygen_applicable
float64 oxygen_available_l
float64 reserve_time_s
float64 reserve_wh
float64 reserve_oxygen_l
---
std_msgs/Header header
